# OpenHD Build Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and adjust paths as needed.

# IMPORTANT: Do not use quotes for values (e.g. use NPROC=4, not NPROC="4")
# Make treats quotes as part of the literal value.

# Number of parallel jobs (defaults to auto-detected CPU count)
# NPROC=4

# --- Submodules ---
# Note: Some submodules (like video_crypto_private) are private.
# If you don't have access, 'make setup' will skip them with a warning.

# --- RK3588 Cross-Compilation ---
# RK3588_TOOLCHAIN=/opt/gcc-12.2.0
# RK3588_SYSROOT=/opt/rk3588_debian12_kernel6_10/sysroot

# --- ORQA SDK ---
# ORQA_SDK=/opt/orqa-sdk

# --- Custom CMake Options ---
# EXTRA_CMAKE=-DCMAKE_VERBOSE_MAKEFILE=ON
